<title>UK: Oester. Investitionskredit sets 300 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Oester. Investitionskredit sets 300 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE INVESTITIONSKREDIT AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    07.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.28    PAY DATE    07.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	*+45 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*SPREAD AT BREAKEVEN OF 99.78</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    MUN/FFT   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 119 OBL DUE 21.MAY.01</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
